		<title type="html"><![CDATA[MD-UV390 VFO Locked After Firmware Restored]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5045&amp;p=36659#p36659"><![CDATA[
I restored the original firmware after I restored the flash memory from the backup I made after installing OpenGD77.  Even after I have written the original codeplug back into the radio, the VFO is locked and the frequency can not be changed.  When I change either the TX or RX frequencies from the keypad, the radio says that the change was successful but when you go back to check, it shows that it has not actually been changed and all the channels have the same frequency depending on whether the original frequency was VHF or UHF no matter what was in the codeplug.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8430">k9dkq</a> — Tue Apr 08, 2025 2:03 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
